guide.ml.p1: In the Interests field, write what matters to you: major, city, budget, scholarships, campus style, and so on.
guide.ml.p2: The system compares this text with university and program descriptions.
guide.ml.p3: More specific interests usually give better recommendations.
guide.ml.p4: Keep it short. Example in English: computer science, scholarships, USA.
guide.ml.p5: Interests help sort options, but they do not replace official university requirements.
